    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d597">

                <pb facs="0721" n="679" sameAs="frus:frus1863p1/pg679"/>

                <head>Lord Lyons to Mr.
                        Seward.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1863-07-27"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >July</hi> 27, 1863.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> With reference to my note of the 21st
                    instant, and to your answer of the 24th instant, I have the honor to transmit to
                    you a letter which I have received from a Mr. George Kilpatrick, and which
                    appears to confirm the allegation that aliens are held by the federal officers
                    at Louisville, in Kentucky, to be liable to perform military service.</p>
                <p>I trust that you will deem it right to call the attention of the proper authority
                    to the subject without delay, and to inform me of the result.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with the highest respect, sir, your most obedient, humble
                    servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>LYONS.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d597-a1.xml" xpointer="d597-a1"/>
            </div>
